  <!-- ── CLI ── -->
  <data name="Usage" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Usage: Pings [config] [options]

Argument:
  config                   Path to the JSON config. Defaults to config.json in the
                           current directory, then next to the executable.

Options:
  -c, --config &lt;path&gt;      Path to the JSON config
      --once               Probe once, print the table, then exit
                           (for scripts/CI; never prompts)
      --lang &lt;tag&gt;         UI language: auto / en / zh-CN (default: from config)
      --no-color           Disable colored output
      --no-pause           Never wait for input (errors or missing config)
      --verbose            Print full stack traces on error
  -h, --help               Show this help
  -v, --version            Show version

Runtime keys:
  C  Acknowledge the current warnings
  Q  Quit

Exit codes:
  0 success      1 bad arguments      2 config error
  3 runtime error    4 unreachable target (--once)</value>
  </data>
